{"user": "how can I play better", "user_ts": "2026-08-26T14:57:06.290812+00:00", "assistant": "You finished **Black 29 \u2013 White 35** \u2014 close.\n\nTo play better in endgames:\n\n- **Don\u2019t chase the biggest flip now.** A move that flips 6 can still lose if White takes a corner/edge after.\n- **Corners are permanent.** Try to force corners; avoid playing next to an empty corner unless you\u2019ve counted it.\n- **Think in sequences:** \u201cIf I play here, what is White\u2019s best reply, then what do I get?\u201d\n- **Mobility matters:** good moves leave White with few legal moves, or force White to play bad squares.\n- **Count the ending:** with few empties, compare final disc totals, not current flips.\n\nBest quick habit: before every endgame move, ask: **\u201cDoes this give White a corner or a strong edge?\u201d** If yes, look for another move.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-26T14:57:12.384521+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-26T14:57:15.372639+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Solution Request"], "votes": {"Solution Request": 3}, "confidence": {"Solution Request": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Solution Request"], "llama": ["Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Neutral Feedback"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Neutral Feedback"], "votes": {"General Principle": 3, "Prompt": 1, "Neutral Feedback": 2, "Board Report": 2, "Hint": 1}, "confidence": {"General Principle": 1.0, "Prompt": 0.3333333333333333, "Neutral Feedback": 0.6666666666666666, "Board Report": 0.6666666666666666, "Hint": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["General Principle", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"], "sonnet": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Neutral Feedback"], "llama": ["Board Report", "General Principle", "Hint"]},